    {
      "title": "The Performer (ESFP)",
      "description": "You're the ultimate music performer! Like an ESFP, you thrive on live music, energetic pop, and sharing your love of music with others. You're outgoing, spontaneous, and express yourself through singing, dancing, and performing—music is your way of connecting with the world and spreading joy to everyone around you.",
      "mbti": "ESFP"
    },
    {
      "title": "The Connoisseur (INTP)",
      "description": "You're the music connoisseur! Like an INTP, you dive deep into underground genres, analyze technical aspects of music, and find beauty in experimental sounds. You're private, analytical, and view music as a complex puzzle to solve—you appreciate the intricacies of production and composition that others might miss.",
      "mbti": "INTP"
    },
    {
      "title": "The Classicist (ISTJ)",
      "description": "You're the music classicist! Like an ISTJ, you value timeless classics, organized playlists, and the reliability of familiar songs. You're practical, responsible, and find comfort in the music that has stood the test of time—rock anthems, golden oldies, and music with meaningful lyrics that speak to enduring truths.",
      "mbti": "ISTJ"
    },
    {
      "title": "The Visionary (INFJ)",
      "description": "You're the music visionary! Like an INFJ, you connect deeply with classical music, emotional lyrics, and music that speaks to the soul. You're private, compassionate, and view music as a spiritual experience—you find meaning in the quiet moments of beauty and use music to process your deepest emotions and connect with your inner self.",
      "mbti": "INFJ"
